    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Owen Reilly are delighted to present this superb two-bedroom ground floor apartment, ideally located in the heart of Rathmines. Presented in excellent condition, the property offers bright, spacious and well-proportioned accommodation, making it an ideal home or investment opportunity.\r\n\r\nThe accommodation comprises a welcoming entrance hall, a generous open-plan kitchen/living/dining area, two spacious double bedrooms and a modern bathroom. Ground floor access provides added convenience, while the property also benefits from one designated parking space.\r\n\r\nMore about the location...\r\n\r\nThe location is truly second to none, with the extensive amenities of Rathmines right on the doorstep. Residents can enjoy easy access to Rathmines Town Centre, Swan Leisure, Omniplex Cinema, and an excellent choice of cafés, bakeries, restaurants, bars and shops.\r\n\r\nThe popular villages of Ranelagh and Rathgar are both within easy walking distance, while St Stephen's Green and Dublin city centre are also readily accessible on foot. With its combination of generous accommodation, ground floor convenience, designated parking and an exceptional city location, this apartment represents an excellent opportunity in one of Dublin's most sought-after neighbourhoods."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Entrance Hall\r\n(2.94m x .9m and 2.67m x .93m)\r\nLaminate flooring and storage cupboard.\r\n\r\n\r\nLiving Room\r\n(4.8m x 3.98m)\r\nGenerously proportioned living room with a feature timber-surround fireplace with an electric fire inset, coving and double doors leading to the outside terrace.\r\n\r\n\r\nKitchen\r\n(3.56m x 1.74m)\r\nExcellent range of built-in wall and floor units, tiled splashback and tiled floor. Integrated appliances include an electric oven, hob, extractor fan, washing machine and fridge freezer.\r\n\r\n\r\nBedroom 1\r\n(3.12 x 2.46m)\r\nDouble bedroom with laminate flooring and built-in wardrobe.\r\n\r\n\r\nBedroom 2\r\n(3.12m x 2.4m)\r\nDouble bedroom with laminate flooring and built-in wardrobe.\r\n\r\n\r\nShower Room\r\n(2.64m x 2m)\r\nExtensively tiled and fitted with a large 1,600mm walk-in shower enclosure, pedestal wash hand basin, WC and storage.\r\n\r\nTerrace\r\n(3m x 1.8m)\r\nAccessed through double doors from the living room."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "Superb two-bedroom ground floor apartment.\r\nIdeally located in the heart of Rathmines.\r\nBright and spacious accommodation.\r\nGenerous open-plan kitchen/living/dining area.\r\nTwo well-proportioned double bedrooms.\r\nModern bathroom.\r\nConvenient ground floor access.\r\nElectric Heating.\r\nService Charge approx. €1,750 p.a.\r\nOne designated parking space."
      },
      {
